PRO-FORMA FIRST BOARD RESOLUTION OF THE GENERAL PARTNER OF [ENTITY NAME] LIMITED PARTNERSHIP

WHEREAS the formation of a limited partnership is necessary for the operation of a digital magazine publishing business in Alberta;

RESOLVED that the General Partner is authorized to file the Certificate of Limited Partnership with the Alberta Corporate Registry;

RESOLVED FURTHER that the registered office of the partnership shall be established at the address [full address] in Alberta;

RESOLVED FURTHER that [Name of General Partner] is appointed as the General Partner and [Name] as the Administrative Partner;

RESOLVED FURTHER that the Partnership Agreement dated [date] is adopted and approved;

RESOLVED FURTHER that all actions of the General Partner to date in preparation for formation are ratified;

RESOLVED FURTHER that the fiscal year shall end on December 31 each year.

This resolution was passed unanimously by the General Partner on [date].
